<!-- General Content / Text 8 or 10 Columns -->
    <div id="general-text-introduction" class="module-container" data-anchor-link>
        <div class="container-txt --small">
            <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-12 mb-30">
                        <div class="" id="">
                            <div class="ricoh-richtext__container ">
                                <div class="ricoh-richtext__content ">
                                    <h2>What is 3D printing?</h2><p><a href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/3d-printing/">3D Printing</a>, otherwise known as Additive Manufacturing (AM), is the process of manufacturing a 3-Dimensional object from a computer-aided design (CAD) or digital 3D model and can be achieved using a diverse range of materials, technologies, and systems.</p>
                                </div>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>


<style nonce="HWJ7aqUaVHw2Sv3ekrfUuUVH41FnJ0p9iAJ3WSMwVPZC5SqsQEkoexk3yV8RnkDZQKdhcA6DedBqlXDp7i5XRw==">
    #aeaa13fd9-19f6-45a7-9179-3fac615e038d {
        --bg-color: #f2f2f2;
    }
</style>
<div class="ctn-background br-16 " id="aeaa13fd9-19f6-45a7-9179-3fac615e038d">



<div id="additive-manufacturing-services" class="module-container" data-anchor-link>
    <div class="section areo --mini-version" data-areo>
        <div class="ctn-background br-16 legacy-bg-color-f2f2f2">
            <div class="container-txt --small text-black">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-11 offset-md-1">
                                                    <h2 class="title-h2">Additive Manufacturing Services</h2>
                        <p class="text-p1 areo__desc">
At Ricoh, we provide comprehensive AM support from initial concept to final production, ensuring quality and reliability throughout every stage of your project.                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-4 offset-md-1">
                        <ul class="areo__link p-0 mt--25">
                                <li>
                                    <h3 class="title-h3 areo__line areo__header">3D Printing</h3>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <h3 class="title-h3 areo__line areo__header">Post-Processing</h3>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <h3 class="title-h3 areo__line areo__header">Consultancy</h3>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <h3 class="title-h3 areo__line areo__header">Design Optimisation</h3>
                                </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                        <div class="areo__content">
                            <div class="accordion">
                                    <div class="areo__item">
                                            <h3 class="title-h3 areo__line accordion__title">3D Printing</h3>
                                            <div class="accordions__arrow"></div>
                                        <div class="areo__text accordion__content">
                                                        <div class="picture-line ">
                                                            <picture>
                                                                <source media="(min-width:901px)" srcset="/media/3d-printing_tcm100-115167.webp">
                                                                <img src="/media/3d-printing_tcm100-115167.webp" alt="areo">
                                                            </picture>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="text-p1 areo__content-desc"><p>Ricoh 3D embodies the true meaning of a <em>total additive manufacturing solution</em>. Our services are designed to support the full product development lifecycle from initial design, through prototyping, to final end‑use parts.</p><p><br />Our technical capabilities span a wide range of 3D printing technologies, including several unique to Ricoh. We offer <a href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/technologies-materials/selective-laser-sintering/">Selective Laser Sintering</a> (SLS), <a href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/technologies-materials/multi-jet-fusion/">Multi Jet Fusion</a> (MJF), <a href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/technologies-materials/fused-deposition-modelling/">Fused Deposition Modelling</a> (FDM), <a href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/technologies-materials/composite-based-additive-manufacturing/">Composite‑Based Additive Manufacturing</a> (CBAM), and <a href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/technologies-materials/binder-jetting/">Aluminium Binder Jetting</a> (BJT). We also provide an extensive portfolio of engineering materials across these technologies. By understanding the properties and performance of each, Ricoh 3D’s engineers can recommend the optimal solution to achieve the customer’s desired outcome.</p><p><br />For those who prefer a self‑service approach, customers can also take advantage of our dedicated <a href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/online-ordering-portal/">Online Ordering Portal</a>, for instant quoting and online ordering. </p></div>
                                                        <a class="cta-arrow text-cta-2" href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/3d-printing/" title="Learn more about our 3D printing capabilities" target="" ><span>Learn more about our 3D printing capabilities</span></a>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="areo__item">
                                            <h3 class="title-h3 areo__line accordion__title">Post-Processing</h3>
                                            <div class="accordions__arrow"></div>
                                        <div class="areo__text accordion__content">
                                                        <div class="picture-line ">
                                                            <picture>
                                                                <source media="(min-width:901px)" srcset="/media/post-processing_tcm100-115170.webp">
                                                                <img src="/media/post-processing_tcm100-115170.webp" alt="areo">
                                                            </picture>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="text-p1 areo__content-desc"><p>Thanks to our 3D post-processing solutions, we can offer a wide variety of ‘finishing’ options that both enhance aesthetics of parts and advance performance. </p><p><br />Ricoh 3D's engineering experts are equipped with the knowledge to suggest optimal finishing services according to a part’s purpose and end-use, such as:</p><ul><li style="font-weight: bold;"><strong>Adhesive Bonding</strong></li><li style="font-weight: bold;"><strong>Smoothing</strong></li><li style="font-weight: bold;"><strong>Dyeing</strong></li><li style="font-weight: bold;"><strong>Threaded Inserts</strong></li></ul></div>
                                                        <a class="cta-arrow text-cta-2" href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/post-processing/" title="Learn more about our post-processing capabilities" target="" ><span>Learn more about our post-processing capabilities</span></a>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="areo__item">
                                            <h3 class="title-h3 areo__line accordion__title">Consultancy</h3>
                                            <div class="accordions__arrow"></div>
                                        <div class="areo__text accordion__content">
                                                        <div class="picture-line ">
                                                            <picture>
                                                                <source media="(min-width:901px)" srcset="/media/consultancy_tcm100-115168.webp">
                                                                <img src="/media/consultancy_tcm100-115168.webp" alt="areo">
                                                            </picture>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="text-p1 areo__content-desc"><p>Whether an individual is new to <a href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/3d-printing/">3D printing</a> or an industry expert, Ricoh 3D offers consultancy as part its wider service offering. We recognise that every project is unique. That is why our dedicated team of experts offer a consultancy service at customers’ facilities to truly understand the business needs and invite customers and partners to our state-of-the-art 3D printing headquarters at <a href="/printing-solutions-europe/">Ricoh Printing Solutions Europe Ltd</a> (RPSE), Telford, UK.</p><p><br />In particular, for Ricoh’s <a href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/technologies-materials/binder-jetting/">aluminium binder jetting technology</a>, stakeholders are encouraged to visit Ricoh 3D’s Metal AM Customer Experience Centre (Metal AM CEC), to enable them to understand and maximise the use of 3D printing during a product development lifecycle, from design, material, process – and everything in-between.</p></div>
                                                        <a class="cta-arrow text-cta-2" href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/consultancy/" title="Learn more about our consultancy approach" target="" ><span>Learn more about our consultancy approach</span></a>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="areo__item">
                                            <h3 class="title-h3 areo__line accordion__title">Design Optimisation</h3>
                                            <div class="accordions__arrow"></div>
                                        <div class="areo__text accordion__content">
                                                        <div class="picture-line ">
                                                            <picture>
                                                                <source media="(min-width:901px)" srcset="/media/design-optimisation_tcm100-115169.webp">
                                                                <img src="/media/design-optimisation_tcm100-115169.webp" alt="areo">
                                                            </picture>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="text-p1 areo__content-desc"><p>Ricoh 3D offers Design for Additive Manufacturing (DfAM) to leverage true design freedom. Whilst millions of parts today are produced using <a href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/3d-printing/">3D printing</a>, many are still designed for traditional manufacturing methods...</p><p><br />We recognise that the true benefits of 3D lie in designing for the manufacturing process from the beginning of a project. Our <a href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/design-optimisation/">design optimisation</a> service realises that ambition of rethinking design with 3D printing in mind. </p><p><br />We use software such as <a href="https://www.ntop.com/" target="_blank">nTop</a>, to precisely meet or exceed specified parameters resulting in innovative designs that are difficult to conceive or translate into CAD data. We can create complex structures and organic shapes, impossible to produce using conventional manufacturing techniques. </p><p><br />By optimising parts, we can achieve benefits of weight reduction, cost reduction, enhanced part consolidation, improved part performance and longevity, and reduced design time, supporting Ricoh’s commitment to <a href="/about-us/sustainability/">sustainability</a>.</p></div>
                                                        <a class="cta-arrow text-cta-2" href="/business-solutions/industrial-printing/ricoh-3d/design-optimisation/" title="Learn more about our design capabilities" target="" ><span>Learn more about our design capabilities</span></a>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


</div>


<style nonce="HWJ7aqUaVHw2Sv3ekrfUuUVH41FnJ0p9iAJ3WSMwVPZC5SqsQEkoexk3yV8RnkDZQKdhcA6DedBqlXDp7i5XRw==">
